WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.560
Hierarchy decides what people notice first, second and third.

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:07.651
First, the main message. Make it the biggest thing.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.848
Second, the key details: where, when and who it is for.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.572
Third, the action: call, visit or scan.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:21.816
Line everything up on a grid, and cut words people don't need.

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:32.666
Before you move on, check: Write the first, second and third message. Use size and colour to show order. Line elements up on a grid. Cut unnecessary words.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:36.175
In the next lesson: Designing for phones.
